# Knowledge A-03 — lean lock (2026-08-06)

Applies to **all future** Siya Health Knowledge carousels / A-03 compositing under
`apps/siya-health/brand/`.

## Default on-frame (locked)

- **Headline** (~10–12% canvas H) + **one sub-headline** only
- Sub-headline (`--recognition`) **is the whole message** — not a teaser for body copy
- **Spokenness:** Sub-headlines must read as something a person would actually say out loud — complete, natural phrasing, even when short. Not a compressed fragment missing connecting words. **Test:** read aloud — if it needs mental reconstruction to parse (e.g. “morning speech” for “the pep talk you give yourself”), it fails regardless of word count
- Magenta rule above sub-headline · full Deep Navy · high contrast on cream
- Teaching depth → **captions**, not the frame
- Close: lean sub-headline (optional) + **one CTA** — no body bullets by default

## Do not

- Put `explanation` / `takeaway` / multi-bullet `body` on-frame by default
- Shrink carousel type below static blur-test size
- Invent a denser layout mid-generate

## Opt-in only

Pass compositor `--dense` **only** when the user/brief explicitly asks for body blocks.
Otherwise ignore those fields even if present in an old copy deck.

